        "markdown": "## Evidence\n\nA direct observation, measurement, experiment, or demonstrated outcome.\n\nRequired identity data: `title`.\n\nAuthored fields: `title`, `observation`, `kind`, `strength`, `sourceRef`.\n\nThe detail surface represents every editor field; card and icon surfaces are deliberate projections."
